{"tt44121637":"Donna Tokoro ni, Ikou kana?","tt48504773":"Tetsuryôkai tte Nandesu ka?","tt49316794":"Hataraku no tte... Taihen desu.","tt49902672":"Sochira no Tenki wa Dou Desu ka?","tt50349391":"Kimazui Mama wa, Iya Dakara.","tt50691698":"Misaki, Tamani wa Hitori de Ganbarimasu!","tt51003090":"Omoide Ippai, Tsukuritai desu!"}